---
---

<section class="band" aria-labelledby="band-title">
  <div class="inner">
    <div class="copy">
      <h2 id="band-title">Diseñado para la luz de día y la cabina nocturna.</h2>
      <p class="lead">
        Modo oscuro para la cabina dimmeada, modo claro para el resplandor de la ventana. El iPad de arriba cambia en vivo,
        sin recargar.
      </p>
      <p class="mode">
        <span class="mode-k">Modo actual</span>
        <strong data-theme-name>Oscuro · #0b0c0f</strong>
      </p>
    </div>

    <button type="button" class="big-toggle" data-theme-toggle aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Cambiar a modo claro">
      <span class="knob" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg class="icon-sun" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"></circle><path d="M12 2v2M12 20v2M4.93 4.93l1.41 1.41M17.66 17.66l1.41 1.41M2 12h2M20 12h2M6.34 17.66l-1.41 1.41M19.07 4.93l-1.41 1.41"></path></svg>
        <svg class="icon-moon" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20.985 12.486a9 9 0 1 1-9.473-9.472c.405-.022.617.46.402.803a6 6 0 0 0 8.268 8.268c.344-.215.825-.004.803.401"></path></svg>
      </span>
      <span class="big-label">
        <span class="to-light">Cambiar a modo claro</span>
        <span class="to-dark">Cambiar a modo oscuro</span>
      </span>
    </button>

    <p class="small">
      Datos de demostración. Los orígenes que muestra cada paso indican de dónde vendrá el dato en el diseño del backend.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .band {
    padding: clamp(80px, 14vh, 160px) 16px;
    border-block: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--fg);
  }
  .inner {
    display: grid;
    gap: 32px 48px;
    align-items: center;
    margin: 0 auto;
    max-width: 1100px;
  }
  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .inner {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
    }
    .small {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }
  }
  h2 {
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(32px, 4.6vw, 64px);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.04;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }
  .lead {
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    max-width: 52ch;
    font-size: clamp(16px, 1.4vw, 20px);
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--fg-2);
  }
  .mode {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 8px 16px;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .mode-k {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--fg-3);
  }
  .mode strong {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  .big-toggle {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    min-height: 88px;
    padding: 12px 32px 12px 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--panel);
    color: var(--fg);
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition:
      background-color 150ms var(--ease-out),
      transform 150ms var(--ease-out);
  }
  .big-toggle:active {
    transform: scale(0.97);
  }
  @media (hover: hover) and (pointer: fine) {
    .big-toggle:hover {
      background: var(--panel-2);
    }
  }
  .knob {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 64px;
    height: 64px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--fg);
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .icon-moon,
  .to-dark {
    display: none;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme='light']) .band .icon-sun,
  :global(:root[data-theme='light']) .band .to-light {
    display: none;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme='light']) .band .icon-moon,
  :global(:root[data-theme='light']) .band .to-dark {
    display: inline;
  }
  .small {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 60ch;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--fg-3);
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .big-toggle {
      transition: none;
    }
  }
</style>
